the templates are:
    *a person* is an infringer.
    *a copyright owner* elects statutory damages.
    *a copyright owner* claims statutory damages.
    *a copyright owner* is not the same person as *an infringer*.
    *a copyright owner* owns the copyright in *a work*.
    *a work* is a work protected by copyright.
    *an infringer* uses *a work*.
    reduced statutory damages of between *a minimum* and *a maximum* are paid.
    statutory damages of between *a minimum* and *a maximum* are paid.
    increased statutory damages of between *a minimum* and *a maximum* are paid.
    *a party* sustains the burden of proof.
    *an infringer* infringed wilfully.

